            <span class="text-sm fg-muted">
              Submitted by         <a href="/user/shotdoubleshot" class="submission__submitter fg-inherit"><strong>shotdoubleshot</strong></a>    <small class="fg-grey text-sm user-flag">t3_z8c751</small>
